# 0158 WIP: N1b shared I2C bit-bang (battery + probe).
# Moves the duplicated bit-bang take/release/read path out of ruby_battery
# and ruby_probe into ruby_hal; the I2C5 lock and console markers stay as
# they were.  No rail/PMIC/clock/WDT writes are added.
#
# KERNEL_EXPECT_EXEC_DATA pins the booted kernel; the pin rerun is the
# gate for the same patchset.
